    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Frederik Boivin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115683250726479024551/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXxMtE7TUULqz99IgAGL0y-1M6NwdGo_P-UD2Kz8_O4wDKO84mazw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "We had the most lovely family day at the alpaca farm in Saint-Lazare! It was such a wonderful and memorable experience, especially for the kids. The alpacas are incredibly gentle and sweet, and getting to interact with them up close was a real treat.\nA huge part of what made the visit so special was the owner. They were so friendly and welcoming, and you can tell they genuinely love what they do. They went out of their way to make sure our group enjoyed our time to its fullest, answering all our questions and making everyone feel right at home.\nWe visited on a cold winter day, and it was pure magic. Seeing the alpacas in the snow was beautiful, and afterward, we got to warm up by a cozy fire with hot chocolate and coffee. It was the perfect touch and made the whole experience feel so special and well-thought-out.\nThey were also fantastic at handling our group. If you're looking for a unique, heartwarming activity that's great for all ages and can accommodate families or larger parties, I can't recommend this place enough. A true 5-star gem",
        "time": 1763260942,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Andrew Laramee",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115664713202649926445/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWadnzzuoQYh2ksS1dmWRB94mmAmX03GqZV7lF3nHg7nY3qcDv5=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "We had an absolutely fantastic time here feeding the alpacas and their one very sweet llama Kiki. Rachel was extremely personable, friendly, and very knowledgeable about everything to do with her alpacas and she made the whole experience even better by telling us all of their names, which ones were family members and the hierarchy of the group. We learned a ton and had a blast feeding them carrots and grain while also being able to pet their necks and backs while they ate. I look forward to returning in summer to see them all again.",
        "time": 1673723260,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Faina Privorotsky",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110297331228873797695/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWCL9k5WijprvyvCGkL4jM3VzqTBbrEQFHC6-ns9xniBtTyhc7A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "What a great place to visit! These alpacas and one llama are so gorgeous, friendly, funny and calm. You can tell they are treated very well, with so much love. The place itself is very clean and well organized. Rachel, the guide, is amazing! Very friendly, kind and knowledgeable, she made our visit to this farm an unforgettable fun! Thank you so much Rachel!",
        "time": 1636728196,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ena T",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105352849590509773693/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV2yKR1oI6It7XrIp8c1GyWrHSVMPKSqbKYsIq0iCkPl2Qt8qvF=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "We did the Alpaca feeding and fire package and our whole group had a blast. Rachel is so friendly, knowledgeable, and funny. We definitely want to come back!",
        "time": 1671408025,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "D Pineault",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106791538628679317985/reviews",
        "language": "en",
