        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJXSVwhZBfIRGAjIgtvBbLsfoTW_y2BKcvAGFxq-iom8dpXLw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Had a great time.  Rachel was excellent and engaging.  She answered any questions we had, help the kids get comfortable with the animals.  A great time was had by all.",
